      <section id="compute.v1.InstancesService.AggregatedList">

      </section>
      <section id="description">
        <p>Retrieves an aggregated list of all of the instances in your project across all regions and zones.</p><p>The performance of this method degrades when a filter is specified on a project that has a very large number of instances.</p><p>To prevent failure, Google recommends that you set the <code translate="no" dir="ltr">returnPartialSuccess</code> parameter to <code translate="no" dir="ltr">true</code>.</p>
      </section>
      <section id="body">

