                      <p>The name of this access configuration. In <code translate="no" dir="ltr">accessConfigs</code> (IPv4), the default and recommended name is <code translate="no" dir="ltr">External NAT</code>, but you can use any arbitrary string, such as <code translate="no" dir="ltr">My external IP</code> or <code translate="no" dir="ltr">Network Access</code>. In <code translate="no" dir="ltr">ipv6AccessConfigs</code>, the recommend name is <code translate="no" dir="ltr">External IPv6</code>.</p>
