                      <p>This signifies the networking tier used for configuring this access configuration and can only take the following values: <code translate="no" dir="ltr">PREMIUM</code>, <code translate="no" dir="ltr">STANDARD</code>.</p><p>If an AccessConfig is specified without a valid external IP address, an ephemeral IP will be created with this networkTier.</p><p>If an AccessConfig with a valid external IP address is specified, it must match that of the networkTier associated with the Address resource owning that IP.</p>
