                  </tr>
                  <tr id="body.InstanceAggregatedList.FIELDS.inlinedField_51">
                    <td><code translate="no" dir="ltr">items.instances[].networkInterfaces[].stackType</code></td>
                    <td>
                      <p><code class="apitype" translate="no" dir="ltr">enum</code></p>
                      <p>The stack type for this network interface. To assign only IPv4 addresses, use IPV4_ONLY. To assign both IPv4 and IPv6 addresses, use <code translate="no" dir="ltr">IPV4_IPV6</code>. If not specified, <code translate="no" dir="ltr">IPV4_ONLY</code> is used.</p><p>This field can be both set at instance creation and update network interface operations.</p>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
