                      <p>Output only. One of EXTERNAL, INTERNAL to indicate whether the IP can be accessed from the Internet. This field is always inherited from its subnetwork.</p><p>Valid only if <code translate="no" dir="ltr">stackType</code> is <code translate="no" dir="ltr">IPV4_IPV6</code>.</p>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
