                    <td><code translate="no" dir="ltr">items.instances[].networkInterfaces[].queueCount</code></td>
                    <td>
                      <p><code class="apitype" translate="no" dir="ltr">integer</code></p>
                      <p>The networking queue count that's specified by users for the network interface. Both Rx and Tx queues will be set to this number. It'll be empty if not specified by the users.</p>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
