                      <p>Specifies the type of the disk, either <code translate="no" dir="ltr">SCRATCH</code> or <code translate="no" dir="ltr">PERSISTENT</code>. If not specified, the default is <code translate="no" dir="ltr">PERSISTENT</code>.</p>
