                    <td><code translate="no" dir="ltr">items.instances[].disks[].interface</code></td>
                    <td>
                      <p><code class="apitype" translate="no" dir="ltr">enum</code></p>
                      <p>Specifies the disk interface to use for attaching this disk, which is either <code translate="no" dir="ltr">SCSI</code> or <code translate="no" dir="ltr">NVME</code>. For most machine types, the default is <code translate="no" dir="ltr">SCSI</code>. Local SSDs can use either NVME or SCSI. In certain configurations, persistent disks can use NVMe. For more information, see <a
                      href="https://cloud.google.com/compute/docs/disks/persistent-disks">About persistent disks</a>.</p>
