                    <td><code translate="no" dir="ltr">items.instances[].disks[].guestOsFeatures[]</code></td>
                    <td>
                      <p><code class="apitype" translate="no" dir="ltr">object</code></p>
                      <p>A list of features to enable on the guest operating system. Applicable only for bootable images. Read <a
