                    <td>
                      <p><code class="apitype" translate="no" dir="ltr">enum</code></p>
                      <p>The ID of a supported feature. To add multiple values, use commas to separate values. Set to one or more of the following values: <ul> <li><code translate="no" dir="ltr">VIRTIO_SCSI_MULTIQUEUE</code></li> <li><code translate="no" dir="ltr">WINDOWS</code></li> <li><code translate="no" dir="ltr">MULTI_IP_SUBNET</code></li> <li><code translate="no" dir="ltr">UEFI_COMPATIBLE</code></li> <li><code translate="no" dir="ltr">GVNIC</code></li> <li><code translate="no" dir="ltr">SEV_CAPABLE</code></li> <li><code translate="no" dir="ltr">SUSPEND_RESUME_COMPATIBLE</code></li> <li><code translate="no" dir="ltr">SEV_LIVE_MIGRATABLE_V2</code></li> <li><code translate="no" dir="ltr">SEV_SNP_CAPABLE</code></li> <li><code translate="no" dir="ltr">TDX_CAPABLE</code></li> <li><code translate="no" dir="ltr">IDPF</code></li> <li><code translate="no" dir="ltr">SNP_SVSM_CAPABLE</code></li> <li><code translate="no" dir="ltr">CCA_CAPABLE</code></li> <li><code translate="no" dir="ltr">SUSPEND_SAFE_FPR</code></li> </ul> For more information, see <a
                      href="/compute/docs/images/create-delete-deprecate-private-images#guest-os-features"> Enabling guest operating system features</a>.</p>
