                    <td><code translate="no" dir="ltr">items.instances[].metadata.items[]</code></td>
                    <td>
                      <p><code class="apitype" translate="no" dir="ltr">object</code></p>
                      <p>Array of key/value pairs. The total size of all keys and values must be less than 512 KB.</p>
