                      <p><code class="apitype" translate="no" dir="ltr">string (<a href="https://developers.google.com/discovery/v1/type-format">bytes</a> format)</code></p>
                      <p>Specifies a fingerprint for this resource, which is essentially a hash of the instance's contents and used for optimistic locking. The fingerprint is initially generated by Compute Engine and changes after every request to modify or update the instance. You must always provide an up-to-date fingerprint hash in order to update the instance.</p><p>To see the latest fingerprint, make <code translate="no" dir="ltr">get()</code> request to the instance.</p><p>A base64-encoded string.</p>
